Subtask 4.4: Testing Configuration Integration
Create a policy set that uses placement rules:
cat > policyset-security.yaml << 'EOF'
apiVersion: policy.open-cluster-management.io/v1beta1
kind: PolicySet
metadata:
  name: security-policyset
  namespace: default
spec:
  description: Security policies for managed clusters
  policies:
    - policy-namespace-security
    - policy-pod-security-standards
    - policy-network-security
EOF
Apply the policy set:
oc apply -f policyset-security.yaml
Create placement bindings to connect policies with placement rules:
cat > placement-binding-dev.yaml << 'EOF'
apiVersion: policy.open-cluster-management.io/v1
kind: PlacementBinding
metadata:
  name: binding-dev-security
  namespace: default
placementRef:
  name: placement-dev-clusters
  kind: PlacementRule
  apiGroup: apps.open-cluster-management.io
subjects:
- name: policy-namespace-security
  kind: Policy
  apiGroup: policy.open-cluster-management.io
- name: policy-resource-quota
  kind: Policy
  apiGroup: policy.open-cluster-management.io
EOF
Apply placement binding:
oc apply -f placement-binding-dev.yaml
Subtask 4.5: Validation and Testing
Check policy compliance status:
oc get policies -o wide
