Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: YAML Syntax Errors
Problem: Configuration fails to apply due to YAML formatting issues.

Solution:

# Validate YAML syntax
python3 -c "import yaml; yaml.safe_load(open('your-file.yaml'))"

# Or use yq if available
yq eval '.' your-file.yaml
Issue 2: Policy Not Applying to Clusters
Problem: Policies are created but not enforced on managed clusters.

Solution:

# Check placement binding
oc get placementbinding -o yaml

# Verify cluster labels match placement rule selectors
oc get managedclusters --show-labels

# Check policy status
oc describe policy policy-name
Issue 3: Cluster Registration Issues
Problem: Managed clusters not appearing or showing as unavailable.

Solution:

# Check cluster status
oc get managedclusters -o wide

# Verify cluster conditions
oc describe managedcluster cluster-name

# Check cluster agent logs (if accessible)
oc logs -n open-cluster-management-agent deployment/klusterlet-registration-agent
